            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[var(--theme-muted)] mt-1">
              M. Forte, B. Price, S. Cohen, N. Xu, and F. Pitié
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[var(--theme-muted)] mt-0.5 italic">
              IEEE International Conference on Multimedia &amp; Expo (ICME), London, UK, 2020.
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[var(--theme-accent)] font-semibold mt-1">
              &bull; Best Paper Runner-Up Award
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2">
              <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/ICME46284.2020.9102942" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-[var(--theme-link)] hover:text-[var(--theme-accent)] hover:underline">
                DOI: 10.1109/ICME46284.2020.9102942 &rarr;
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded border border-[var(--theme-border)] bg-[var(--theme-card)]/20">
